@StockApiUrl = http://localhost:5001
@ProductId = f070066a-330a-45bd-9ee2-29c2c7d50d58

### Cadastrar produto

POST {{StockApiUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "PRD-001",
  "description": "Teclado mecânico K87",
  "stockQuantity": 24,
  "unitPrice": 289.90
}

### Listar produtos

GET {{StockApiUrl}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

### Diminuir estoque

POST {{StockApiUrl}}/api/products/{{ProductId}}/stock/decrease
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 3
}

### Tentar diminuir além do saldo disponível

POST {{StockApiUrl}}/api/products/{{ProductId}}/stock/decrease
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 100
}

### Tentar diminuir uma quantidade inválida

POST {{StockApiUrl}}/api/products/{{ProductId}}/stock/decrease
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 0
}